Package: censusindia
Title: Census of India Data, 1901-2011, with Boundaries and Projections
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", , "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Tables from every decennial Census of India from 1901 to 2011:
    population time series, Primary Census Abstracts at state, district and
    sub-district level, mother tongue tables, and Scheduled Caste and
    Scheduled Tribe populations, together with Ministry of Health and Family
    Welfare population projections to 2036. Historical series are drawn
    from Jolad and Singh (2026) <doi:10.7910/DVN/ON8CP8>. Census variables
    can be returned with state or district boundaries of the matching
    census year attached for mapping. Boundary files and the largest
    village-level tables are downloaded on first use and cached locally.
